<title>NETHERLANDS: MACINTOSH H1 NET PLUNGES TO DFL 2.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>MACINTOSH H1 NET PLUNGES TO DFL 2.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>MAASTRICHT, Netherlands 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.55 vs   1.42</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.3  vs  10.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			     517.2  vs 475.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.4  vs  12.5</p>
<p>    Interest charge			0.8  vs   0.1 gain</p>
<p>    Tax					1.7  vs   2.3</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 1.6  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Retail group Macintosh NV said in July it expected</p>
<p>the 1996 first-half net to drop to about two million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
